eviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 06-10-2023, 02:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T11:13:21-07:00","id":1514485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-2-juneupdate-faq\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-2-juneupdate-faq\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-2-juneupdate-faq\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-2-juneupdate-faq </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b><u>Edition: First Blood</u></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Can I keep my pre-order? </b><br /> <br /> <i><b>Yes,</b></i><i> the First Blood Edition remains and you can keep your pre-order. You do not have to take any action for this.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Can I get a refund? </b><br /> <br /> <i><b>Yes, </b></i><i>if you send in a request to the store where you pre-ordered you can get a refund.</i> <b><u>Edition: Unsanctioned</u></b><br /> <br /> <b>Can I keep my pre-order? </b><br /> <br /> <i><b>Yes,</b></i><i> the Unsanctioned Edition remains and you can keep your pre-order. You do not have to take any action for this.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Can I get a refund? </b><br /> <br /> <i><b>Yes,</b></i><i> if you send in a request to the store where you pre-ordered you can get a refund.</i> <b><u>Edition: Blood Moon</u></b><br /> <br /> <b>Can I keep my pre-order? </b><br /> <br /> <i><b>Yes,</b></i><i> the Blood Moon Edition remains and you can keep your pre-order. You do not have to take any action for this.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Can I get a refund? </b><br /> <br /> <i><b>Yes, </b></i><i>if you send in a request to the store where you pre-ordered you can get a refund.</i> <b><u>Edition: Collector\u2019s Edition</u></b><br /> <br /> <b>Can I keep my pre-order? </b><br /> <br /> <i><b>No</b></i><i>, all Collector\u2019s Edition pre-orders are being refunded.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Can I get a refund? </b><br /> <br /> <i><b>Yes,</b></i><i> all Collector\u2019s Edition pre-orders are being refunded.</i> <b><u>Edition: Other Physical Products</u></b><br /> <br /> <b>Can I keep my pre-order? </b><br /> <br /> <i><b>No,</b></i><i> all physical product pre-orders are being refunded.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Can I get a refund? </b><br /> <br /> <i><b>Yes,</b></i><i> all other physical product pre-orders are being refunded</i> </div> </div> </div>\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T11:28:49-07:00","id":1514487,"title":"","content":"Reading the <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-2-juneupdate-faq\" target=\"_blank\">Paradox-page</a>, it actually does kinda confirm that we're in for some changes in regards to what Bloodlines 2 is:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Why are you refunding all physical products?<br /> <br /> With the <b>bonus content being updated</b>, the prior physical edition offered items that are <b>no longer representative of the game</b>. This includes the Collector\u2019s Edition created and sold by DPA Merchandising GmbH(formerly Gaya Entertainment GmbH), and all physical versions of the First Blood edition, Unsanctioned edition and Blood Moon edition disc.\u200b<br /> <br /> [...]<br /> <br /> When will you add information about the content in First Blood and Blood Moon editions?<br /> <br /> We will share <b>information about what each edition contains before resuming pre-orders</b>. Following the standard refund policies of our resellers, most platforms will allow for refunds during the entire pre-order period in case you are not satisfied with the added content.\u200b </div> </div> </div> (Emphasis mine)<br /> <br /> And the whole FAQ is about whatever version you bought, you can get a refund. It's just that all the pre-order versions with physical items are auto-canceled.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T15:17:08-07:00","id":1514516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514142-paradox-will-make-a-bloodlines-2-announcement-in-september?p=1514443#post1514443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah. And to avoid legal liability, they're ensuring that preorders are refunded. Because otherwise, they'd be asking people to give their money to a product that's not the one they asked for/were sold on.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, it looks like a very nice set of patio furniture. No, I'm not paying for that, because I asked for a <i>boat</i>.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Y'know, this situation with the canceled BL2 pre-orders reminds me of what's currently going on with a game published under them called &quot;Empire of Sin&quot;. For whatever reason, the developing studio for that game, &quot;Romero Games&quot;, has NOT filled almost ANY of their Expansion DLC obligations with no signs from Paradox or Romero issuing refunds or any form of recompense. I think Paradox refunded the pre-orders because they <i>had</i> to since Bloodlines is such a large game with a large following.<br /> <br /> But Empire of Sin? A no-name game like that? Just pure banal radio silence from Paradox on ANYONE who took a chance on Empire of Sin. Thank the gods I'm more wizzened to PDX's bullshit and didn't buy it all, but boy is that whole situation is awkward (and probably HIGHLY illegal).<br /> <br /> Paradox is easily one of the worst game companies in the industry next to EA in my personal opinion. The reason why they can skirt by and not get major flak, is because they produce games for a niche market in the gaming industry for a niche subset of gamers (those interested in grand strategy games like myself).<br /> <br /> I really have NO high-hopes for whatever developer they've chosen to have work on Bloodlines 2.<br /> <br /> Paradox gaining the rights to the World of Darkness was a mistake.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Relevant links for the whole Empire of Sin situation to gawk at:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/604540/discussions/0/3820784984087422549/\" target=\"_blank\">It's official, this game is dead.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/604540/discussions/0/6142387869100523887/\" target=\"_blank\">time for a class action lawsuit?</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/604540/discussions/0/6637787280765002538/\" target=\"_blank\">i don't wanna get scammed mane</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/604540/discussions/0/6637787280765002538/\" target=\"_blank\">Scam?</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/604540/discussions/0/3492004456593082573/\" target=\"_blank\">Where is Expansion 2 from the Season Pass</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/604540/discussions/0/3387294407395469929/\" target=\"_blank\">Did they really abandon the game?</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":25523,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","user":"Shakanaka","date":". 06-10-2023, 06:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T15:27:14-07:00","id":1514518,"title":"","content":"They have the money and they can try to capitalize it. What they end up doing with it is down to them. It's not about &quot;right or wrong&quot;, but whether you have money or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T15:45:13-07:00","id":1514520,"title":"","content":"That feels like a very strange take.<br /> <br /> Nobody's even talking about &quot;right vs. wrong&quot; in some moralistic sense. There was an assessment of &quot;wrong&quot; in the sense of a failure of systems: inputs not creating the desired outputs.<br /> <br /> The idea that there's no ethical or moral aspect to this, just having money or not, is also a pretty suspect proposition. Even in the most cynical capitalist view, Paradox has an ethical duty to its shareholders not to spend money in a detrimental (aka &quot;wrong&quot;) fashion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T17:27:02-07:00","id":1514526,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_q